# 2048 Game

## About

This is a simple 2048 game made using Python.

The game has a 4×4 board. The player moves the numbers using the keyboard.

When two same numbers meet, they are combined.

## Controls

```text
A = Move Left
D = Move Right
W = Move Up
S = Move Down
Q = Quit
```

## Example

```text
--- 2048 ---
. . 2 .
. . . .
. 4 . .
. . . .

Move (a/d/w/s, q=quit): a
```

## Concepts Used

* Python
* Lists
* 2D lists
* Functions
* Loops
* Conditions
* Random numbers
* User input

## How to Run

Open the terminal and type:

```text
python game_2048.py
```

